<article class="entry" id="productsense">
  <span class="tag">Hackathon winner</span>
  <h3>ProductSense AI: a GPT-based shopping assistant</h3>
  <p class="meta"><span class="venue">Oct 2023</span></p>
  <figure class="fig" data-fig>
    {% include "figures/productsense.svg" %}
    <figcaption>From a photo of a label to a decision: OCR reads the ingredients, a fine-tuned language model judges them, and the app suggests a better alternative.</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <p>An end-to-end shopping assistant built with Python, AWS, Flask, OCR and large language models, giving real-time insight into a product's health and environmental impact. Fine-tuning with PEFT reduced hallucinations by up to 36% in product evaluation and recommendation. Won HackPSU 2023.</p>
